[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5225284385","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114954#issuecomment-5225284385","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114954","id":5225284385,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN3ODIQ","user":{"login":"milanraphael","id":18554422,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTU0NDIy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18554422?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael","html_url":"https://github.com/milanraphael","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/milanraphael/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-08T08:15:21Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T08:15:21Z","body":"Still reproduces in 4.7.1.stable.mono on Linux, so this does not look Windows- or D3D12-specific.\n\n**System information** Godot v4.7.1.stable.mono.official [a13da4feb] - CachyOS (Linux 6.18.42) - OpenGL API 4.6 (Core Profile) Mesa 26.1.6-arch3.1 - Compatibility - AMD Radeon 780M Graphics (radeonsi, phoenix, ACO)\n\n**What I see** The embedded game window renders the game into a region at the top-left that matches the size shown in the embed toolbar, while the embed frame itself is larger. The remaining area is left grey. The size the game is given appears to follow the editor layout at the moment Play is pressed rather than the current size of the embed frame.\n\nProject settings are not involved. `display/window/stretch/mode` is unset (so `disabled`), and no game code touches window or viewport size. Setting Editor Settings > Run > Window Placement > Game Embed Mode to `Disabled` removes the problem completely: the game then fills its window at every size.\n\nFor what it is worth (and not 100% similar), #113462 was closed as completed, but the change there was described by its own author as a workaround rather than a root-cause fix, and the question of whether the embed sizing logic was responsible was never picked up. That seems consistent with this still happening a release later.\n\n<img width=\"2880\" height=\"1800\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/33678cac-f0fa-42c1-9e32-0b4a5ad59987\" />\n\n<img width=\"2880\" height=\"1800\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c789e9f0-0d80-4cdf-97a8-0603d9c1a761\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5225284385/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5225595865","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114954#issuecomment-5225595865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114954","id":5225595865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABN3hD2Q","user":{"login":"Saulo-de-Souza","id":17336909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MzM2OTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17336909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza","html_url":"https://github.com/Saulo-de-Souza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Saulo-de-Souza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-08T09:53:43Z","updated_at":"2026-08-08T09:53:43Z","body":"This PR #115243 fixes the issue, as I had discovered the cause of the problem.\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=d4LSpbCinCw","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5225595865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]